          "text": "Témoignages: [N118] de BORDEAUX (33) vers NANTES (44) 07.07.2007",
          "text_sha256": "e386e194846da1db18dccf0cdf53b7b2ee4a41fb3d628e163a11a7c7635536d2"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
